 Presque Isle County","/arc-plc/michigan/presque-isle-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 10 grids, January to February came in under 90% of normal in 34 years, and so did February to March. In 2025, the middle of the grids got 67% of normal in April to May and 74% in September to October. So far in 2026, March to April came in at 226% of normal on the middle of the grids.</p>"}
